<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F4F6F9', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 88, background: '#1F3A6E', padding: '0 40px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: '600', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>科技温度计周报｜市场情绪监测</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.75)', marginTop: 5 }}>信号源：科技温度计　|　标的：产业趋势组合（模拟）　|　数据截至 2026-09-24</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.85)' }}>2026 年第 40 周</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0' }}>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 16, height: 88 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E5E8EE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '13px 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7B8494' }}>当前温度计读数（09-24）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2F6FED', marginTop: 2 }}>33.6°</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E5E8EE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '13px 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7B8494' }}>上周读数（周一 09-21）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: '600', color: '#4A5464', marginTop: 2 }}>39.9°</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F1FAF3', border: '1px solid #CFE9D6', borderRadius: 12, padding: '13px 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7B8494' }}>边际变化（较上周一）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: '600', color: '#16A34A', marginTop: 2 }}>−6.3° ↓ 下降</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E5E8EE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '10px 12px', display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Image src="assets/p1_temp_tmt.png" style={{ width: 1027, height: 400 }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, background: '#EFF4FE', borderRadius: 10, padding: '8px 18px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1A1D26', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontWeight: '600', color: '#1F3A6E' }}>本周解读：</Text>温度计较上周一回落 6.3°，当前 33.6° 已跌破 40° 低温触发区；回落主要由「行业拥挤度」（59.0→41.3，−17.7pt）与「250日月跌幅均指滚动百分位」（36.5→22.0，−14.5pt）两项得分走低拖累，10 个因子中 8 项下滑。温度计为 10 因子等权合成，对比区间 2026-09-21 → 2026-09-24。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, right: 0, bottom: 0, height: 30, background: '#1F3A6E', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', padding: '0 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.8)' }}>01 / 02</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
